# deploy/apex-web/Caddyfile.document-pipeline.snippet - site block for the shared Caddy on apex-web (container umami-caddy-1, file /opt/umami/Caddyfile).
# PROPOSED (built, not deployed). Since 2026-10-15. Not installed: the block is merged at step 10 of RUNBOOK-document-pipeline.md by a copy of /opt/agent-history/ops/install-caddy-route.sh, which merges it and reloads Caddy (README.md). The hostname must be DNS only (grey cloud),
# or Caddy cannot get its certificate. The block must stay the last thing in this file: the install script of the chandra stack
# takes everything from the hostname line to the end.
# The runtime does not serve /agent.json, and the advert's detail_uri points at it, so that one path goes to the service.
# Everything else goes to the runtime.
mp-suppliers-pipeline.hal8.ai {
    handle /agent.json {
        reverse_proxy document-pipeline-service:9092
    }
    handle {
        reverse_proxy document-pipeline-agent:8080
    }
}
